This product operationalizes the OWASP Agentic Skills Top 10 (AST01-AST10)
whitepaper as a set of provider-agnostic agent skills. The repository credits
the OWASP project as the source whitepaper; Jacky Chan is a credited
Reviewer/Contributor to that publication (run-plan.md "Confirmed decisions").

